### Documentation examples only. Retain JSESSIONID in a cookie-aware HTTP client.
### Replace the zero IDs with values from server responses. Refresh csrf after each login.
### For automatic ID/key capture, import docs/postman/SafePay_Enhanced_Examples.postman_collection.json.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@csrf = paste-X-CSRF-TOKEN-from-an-authenticated-GET
@accountId = 0
@beneficiaryId = 0
@lowTransactionId = 0
@hardHoldTransactionId = 0
@protectedTransactionId = 0
@autoTransactionId = 0

### Register a customer: creates one SAVINGS account with INR 5000
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo Customer","email":"customer@example.com","phone":"9876543210","password":"ChooseDemoPassword"}

### Customer login; retain JSESSIONID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"customer@example.com","password":"ChooseDemoPassword"}

### Copy accountId and X-CSRF-TOKEN from the current account response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/current

### Log out before switching to administrator
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### ADMIN login: supply the actual password configured at local startup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@safepay.local","password":"ReplaceWithConfiguredAdminPassword"}

### Capture fresh administrator CSRF
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts

### Set absolute simulated balance to INR 1000000, before sending payments
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/accounts/{{accountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"balance":"1000000.00","accountType":"SAVINGS"}

### Log out; repeat customer login and current-account GET above to refresh customer CSRF
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Add a beneficiary as CUSTOMER; save beneficiaryId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/beneficiaries
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"beneficiaryName":"Demo Recipient","bankAccountNumber":"123456789012","ifsc":"SBIN0001234"}

### LOW: even the first INR 5000 payment settles immediately; save lowTransactionId
### Fresh walkthrough balance becomes INR 995000. No verify or cancel applies to this payment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: amount-policy-low-001

{"fromAccountId":{{accountId}},"beneficiaryId":{{beneficiaryId}},"amount":"5000.00","purpose":"Amount-only low example"}

### VERY_HIGH: INR 150000 enters HARD_HOLD; save hardHoldTransactionId
### Balance remains INR 995000 with INR 150000 reserved; no automatic expiry.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: amount-policy-hard-hold-001

{"fromAccountId":{{accountId}},"beneficiaryId":{{beneficiaryId}},"amount":"150000.00","purpose":"Amount-only authentication example"}

### Verify the HARD_HOLD using its owner's password; successful balance INR 845000
### Reuse this key/password on a retry: no second debit. Do not use lowTransactionId.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{hardHoldTransactionId}}/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: amount-policy-verification-001

{"password":"ChooseDemoPassword"}

### MEDIUM: INR 20000 is PROTECTED for 10 seconds; save protectedTransactionId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: amount-policy-medium-001

{"fromAccountId":{{accountId}},"beneficiaryId":{{beneficiaryId}},"amount":"20000.00","purpose":"Amount-only cancellation example"}

### Send immediately before the 10-second deadline. Balance stays INR 845000.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{protectedTransactionId}}/cancel
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: amount-policy-cancellation-001

### HIGH: INR 60000 is PROTECTED for 60 seconds; save autoTransactionId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: amount-policy-high-001

{"fromAccountId":{{accountId}},"beneficiaryId":{{beneficiaryId}},"amount":"60000.00","purpose":"Amount-only high timer example"}

### Repeat this GET every five seconds until SETTLED after expiry/scheduler pass
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/{{autoTransactionId}}

### After HIGH settlement the fresh-walkthrough balance is INR 785000
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/current

### Customer profile edit; password may be omitted
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/current
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Demo Customer Updated","email":"customer@example.com","phone":"9876543210"}

### Include inactive beneficiaries; the default list stays ACTIVE-only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/beneficiaries?includeInactive=true

### Remove an owned beneficiary by soft deletion
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/beneficiaries/{{beneficiaryId}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Reactivate the owned beneficiary
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/beneficiaries/{{beneficiaryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Reports require ADMIN: log out, log in as ADMIN and capture fresh admin CSRF first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports/transactions/summary

### Inclusive daily report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reports/transactions/daily?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30

### Reuse the same key/body only for retries. Give every new payment a new key.
### Existing transaction decisions remain saved; an old key is never rescored under the new policy.
